description: Frontend conventions for the Next.js review console
globs: frontend/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow `.cursor/skills/leaseflow-frontend/SKILL.md` for the architecture map, UI rules, test conventions, and verification commands.

- All HTTP calls go through `lib/api.ts`; response types live in `lib/types.ts`.
- The UI displays backend decisions about approval and policy; it never computes them.
- Every UI change includes a Vitest test that mocks `fetch` at the network boundary.
- Before finishing, run `npm run lint`, `npm run typecheck`, `npm test`, and `npm run build` from `frontend/`.
